#: scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a194f81d99f99b075f7f7fb3cbe8eb71f9563151befd0941f9cb93d49627d84a
#. default-sha256: 43f3c16b6db522cecc950c8d01bf39e388571e06a908cb4c1ffb78c77a75cf39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I didn’t really "
"understand Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Non riuscivo a capire "
"affatto Michel."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfcacabb39c97e218afd9bb9922d0dcf1c705f1d0b26bbde26ca8fab3f3d724c
#. default-sha256: 1f556a8f06eaccb85e7d7c43f51bbdb12c43ca55af2fcfd21a5e5e268451943a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that was probably because we were still essentially strangers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Forse perché in fondo eravamo ancora degli sconosciuti."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54d7d1fa9783d39b7c2e392ff24f7ac51c50152b06bf96c1b8c036d1dd1fdc95
#. default-sha256: cc3413d3ede01ef8f9372c4931cd7f8917e6111a579185b7505d4ac2609fb0e9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having been sent to the mansion as reparation for my mistakes,⟪k:1⟫I wasn’t sure who I might "
"find there,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Essendo stata mandata alla villa per rimediare ai miei errori,⟪k:1⟫non ero sicura di chi "
"avrei potuto trovarci,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 839a335c21f542bf910ea9858687917fc39ea4dee45492f4b3ede444de096d33
#. default-sha256: 6ff98c65cc36ace1df4770df02682e1e59a4a0940aa0fa51a186238e75767342
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but I was tentatively convinced he wasn’t a ⟪k:1⟫terrible⟪k:2⟫ person.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He didn’t do "
"anything to me—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫except stay away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma ero convinta che non fosse una ⟪k:1⟫brutta⟪k:2⟫ persona.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non mi faceva niente di "
"male—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫tranne starmi alla larga."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 886ee4f4ed071ef40bebd2a2acf9d15a702a0ecfd5b20c42dd754ce195e0c6e8
#. default-sha256: fa1a82d007a27ee4ca2002bc7bf2c2f1958a3e62627cb7ceeb4f57f7b9745aad
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his time in his chambers,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Michel trascorreva la maggior parte del tempo in camera sua,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f955e47ae4a92f6429c17567b42e53deb16cc5be981458ce4848b1ecd8595753
#. default-sha256: 9c7f87868f3e3657a485d070458ed43c4c86de1932cfbefc3cda84303dcee463
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫which he had told me to never enter under any circumstances,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫nella quale mi aveva ordinato di non entrare, in qualunque circostanza,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37f1da9479afef0b464bf9cd7cc1ac8fb6c09dc2d7835794e407a3538c57521a
#. default-sha256: 5cb9ff94b850f6fefe9fb89aed22b50e59cc9557202618114961b96112473e41
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we rarely encountered one another in the halls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫perciò ci incontravamo raramente per i corridoi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 230eb28df46900509ba2c6653184a56724b00824fce2b29eb7e79176afc10ebd
#. default-sha256: 9ec969b1d86c600659f845138d3d1d478f7cb19afb0987ac8ae20a08a8827d62
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For that reason, I made an effort to be kind and cheerful on the sporadic occasions we ⟪k:1⟫"
"did⟪k:2⟫ cross paths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per questo motivo, mi sforzai di essere gentile e allegra nelle sporadiche occasioni in cui "
"le nostre strade si incrociavano."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f8fd9f10b0b422b7e60d6f49a16825766adf24fca82e0020aeb19d98e6c40ba
#. default-sha256: 624bfde7e218044dc51a519920bc250282d2010312a0671e59f08ea3c19f96f2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I figured if I kept that up long enough,⟪k:1⟫he would eventually warm up to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pensavo che continuando ad apparire in quel modo,⟪k:1⟫prima o poi si sarebbe affezionato a "
"me."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f649779b9444aa51a391fe9f7b792b540f6befb66d755804751327ad6a565b01
#. default-sha256: 1576357a6c841dd0eea57d282a1247e58ce50263ebefbd6ad6ee2f83a807aecb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as new housemates, being able to enjoy our time together was obviously preferable to the "
"alternative."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E in quanto coinquilini, riuscire a goderci il nostro tempo insieme⟪k:1⟫era ovviamente "
"preferibile al non andare d’accordo affatto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a3791bfec8d3a9e6648cd8ef62828b22fa63e9a1dbe0142f1ec2a31cc411dce
#. default-sha256: af69b4f304bc7960899c23c2849ae89a959f5fce676ddd2bfc0d1cb401ec80a6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I did manage to break the ice, I hoped we would be able to do some talking—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"about the mansion, about him, about me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se fossi riuscita a rompere il ghiaccio, avremmo potuto parlare⟪k:1⟫un po’—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫della "
"villa, di lui, di me."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a73c8d551ecfbcc1c9bb7effeac07453274c3a024ac37fe3edb27fca3abca29
#. default-sha256: 8303d86a20b0c6ba948745c5b9a5f5cde60dbddc7c814472e8272e514a488024
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just had to keep working at it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dovevo solo continuare a lavorarci su."

#: scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7952fad908eae26da68fb4c628664ec9038274b54c7d985b5855e3112f7f45d
#. default-sha256: 802920bfc8376e2350291896960219dfe97d556d520451f4fbc6e42b42068ebc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel didn’t need me to take care of him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He handled his own day-to-day needs "
"and activities by himself,⟪k:4⟫and in fact, he didn’t ask me for anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel non aveva bisogno che io mi prendessi cura di lui.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Si occupava dei "
"propri bisogni quotidiani da solo;⟪k:4⟫difatti non mi chiedeva mai nulla."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 166b0ff4fffb820d953fa32da7ddedccae4ce3e182953258e94e0dabc60ad966
#. default-sha256: 61e04f2648d845f17c1a80b98084524def6091c9b96f3264f1efde1cc5fa506e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫An aristocrat who had no use for his servant—⟪k:1⟫I hadn’t met anyone like him before."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un aristocratico che non se ne faceva niente dei propri servitori—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫non avevo mai "
"conosciuto qualcuno come lui prima."

#: scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1933055a777ba7281d6866b7020d62b90ad5820363bb7d9b8af6e9e20a4050b
#. default-sha256: 4fe69e51598fe8d5040cc496bbdec0f10a566ddc39c8f72c99dda9557732391f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All right, then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫D’accordo, allora."

#: scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a38300ceba34c232670c2d2b59da037e260ed72b64ba12b7277f3552e9ced2e2
#. default-sha256: e7580d97121934d753292e56be310a592218dff88ae6b185a0f35b0130803a1b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That meant about all I could do was clean."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pertanto, l’unica cosa che potevo fare era pulire."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c330e94f2a899f2b5a28c4b8e0cee43b10191ce2cdb147b77da2f6c4c5b3f6a1
#. default-sha256: dafec6b6cb3956b70f0a102ca8d3ad74f2d516dc2489adb2e69bbf7deb98be49
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure how his room looked,⟪k:1⟫but the rest of the house was, quite frankly,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non sapevo in che condizioni era la sua stanza,⟪k:1⟫ma il resto della casa, francamente..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfa59b30441123f3c4c15a5c6030f6067b0aa18524b81133ba0146a35998b9c8
#. default-sha256: ebb7411fce7ca9963c35917a6aea39a4c79e21d0059bd2f92ab4912bfaf4eb44
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫an absolute disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫era un assoluto disastro."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60e12f2eeab9d9be5f23b8a46f4f2cd887f05c81f4ceb7eb3ac62c12cb8a7ebb
#. default-sha256: e53856a7e522c5670d5abf94ed9e41d3ab8864b5027e9992a213b41acb12d2dc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The dust was so heavy it was obvious it hadn’t been touched in years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A giudicare dalla quantità di polvere, era ovvio che la villa non fosse stata pulita da anni."

#: scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a01ad1e426e29734619754373b995f95c4a8052792d38932b7a7493e6b2e5b4
#. default-sha256: a4b68c0f1f28907ea20f4211f1f3e4d21a09dfdddfdba4c7f0f66ba62d0917b3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Let’s get started!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Diamoci da fare!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c87f1df2e9c2ee5ee85c29ff287131b800cc0d4bfab26a5f119cee7a3d1a1ff3
#. default-sha256: 5204c2e40881f739823cd3be4c868bdbd5e843f71af6c86782f23bf08ac84c3b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It couldn’t be healthy to live in these conditions, so I set out to clean each room in the "
"house one by one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non era affatto salutare vivere in quello stato, così decisi di pulire ogni stanza della "
"casa, una per una."

#: scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca47acf52de9254672d9673f98e4060e16034b213142bc40b715b9e6cd890dfd
#. default-sha256: 81b612d829c8e2b6fb59e8f1bc073e3057f58c45ef3c1e5b9a5a022d1ccaf7d9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, it wasn’t going to be an easy task."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma non sarebbe stata un’impresa facile."

#: scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb33d2e1601d9d9251b755017cc8262286db2b7bdc8a66be3931de93f60a6f27
#. default-sha256: 1d6ddbfb3c9ef9cefdb9ca414954bc6a56abdf96d73f611628ff71b3c37d44e4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not because I was bad at cleaning—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in fact, I considered myself quite good at it—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non perché fossi inadatta alle pulizie—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫anzi, mi consideravo piuttosto abile—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccf4863b70d6eead488fa1025cb4a6df6271d13da7162fb2bb350680b9dd13ea
#. default-sha256: cd9bdda76ae58c54ede3b1f1eebb0296ac3757802d842159eac2b55fef8f7106
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but because it was near impossible to find all the dust and grime that needed cleaning under "
"the flickering light of a candle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ma perché era quasi impossibile trovare tutta la polvere e lo sporco con la sola luce "
"tremolante di una candela."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fd8248af012899cef2f6642f02b7c10489d0944c4e1dcb8919b8e97f82b6a58
#. default-sha256: e3809d264f853a30562b500343caefc91d17ef36844f1316772ca8564c0e9348
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can’t understand how anyone sane can live in this dark.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What’s wrong with him?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non riesco a capire come qualcuno sano di mente possa vivere con questo buio.⟪k:1⟫ Cosa c’è "
"che non va in lui?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc663ca213792faf91692176de4a2a7cf2eeee82ddd0d6df796700359347edce
#. default-sha256: 82a21bf78ef112182b35e501bdba97fe6a150793b025f1781ec4a439d777c2df
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Maybe... ⟪k:1⟫he’s actually a vampire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Forse... ⟪k:1⟫è davvero un vampiro."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CE48C0B_1CCE_4B76_9C3C_186F60FDDC5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e7dd869faab237acf7622deb9b5399fb869ef5139bdb2ef3fecd33961ba4851
#. default-sha256: dd18342b14a53e733470ab9e7f6c4b8e236f8a0e4c1318ba69d24437b6880da3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4CE48C0B_1CCE_4B76_9C3C_186F60FDDC5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫........................"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫........................"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6490CE95_9D82_48C8_ABE5_66AB0FDCE1D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf095721234334be19a318cdeb61e433a549a5353368944c25cb3b54e8a5be75
#. default-sha256: bb7c8e26974019b09d8b322b0af08eb51a26781730be06301c0d06956c39e3c8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6490CE95_9D82_48C8_ABE5_66AB0FDCE1D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh god, hahaha, wouldn’t that be something.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can see it now... ⟪k:3⟫him sneaking "
"out every night to suck the blood of pretty girls.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Priceless!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oddio, hahaha, sarebbe fantastico.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Me lo immagino a sgattaiolare fuori dalla sua "
"stanza ogni notte,⟪k:3⟫intenzionato a succhiare il sangue delle belle ragazze.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sarebbe "
"il massimo!"

